5) CURRENT FUNCTIONAL DESIGN
A) Timeframe controls

Cloud Timeframe:

Drives VWMA+MACD scaling behavior.

Candles Timeframe:

Drives grouped candle period boundaries.

B) Clouds/MACD logic

VWMA anchor uses Cloud Timeframe scaled length.

MACD multipliers are scaled by Cloud Timeframe.

C) Grouped candles

Grouped candle rendering is overlay-only.

Candle period is clock-aligned using timeframe boundary changes.

Each grouped candle is drawn as one wide candle object:

body via box

wick via line

Includes realtime updating of the currently forming grouped candle.

D) Global master toggles

Added global on/off toggles for:

Clouds

Lines

Histograms

Candles

Per-series toggles still exist and now combine with global toggles.

